<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51109" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσο-πᾰλής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>equal in the struggle,
				well-matched</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαχομένων . . καὶ γενομένων ἰσοπαλέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.82
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.49
			</span></i>; <i>evenly balanced</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ctes.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					29.31
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>equivalent, equal</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. πάντῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Parm.
					8.44
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. κίνδυνοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.39
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλήθει ἰ. τισί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.94
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτι ὥριφος ἰ. τοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					5.30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. ἤματι νύξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.384.18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>A.</u>
				1014
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λῶς</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				364
			</span></i>.</div>
